<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed men attacked civilians heading to market in western Niger, killing at least 37 people. Rival jihadist groups JNIM and ISSP intensified clashes in northern Burkina Faso. Ukrainian officers are training Sahel militants on drone use. In northern Nigeria, violence forced tens of thousands of civilians to flee into Niger and opposition leader Atiku accused President Tinubu of failing Nigerians after 638 people were killed and 64,000 fled. The war produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9nbXFMQ3VGb1NoQmhSRlh0dUdpU1ZGVm44MVRxZFNGODFuVmp1RjRGR2hLYzZnUWpUWWpoV0RieWpCZ0lYVXJwR1ZMTlgtOThMdmVTcUhveElmcEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE1LLTU5ODhPMVdaRk05SVF3cW8za3p2d3hON3ZrUUpuYjlZN3J4REU5eUh5b2JRa1IxRjZJd1g5eVJOSHE0dFI3X2ZDaUtfZi1fX0EwQkRzOHJ0NFJOVmpLUFpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;재경일보&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOeWNTZ1pFc2Q4ZXFLY0hhN3RsWVpUZkhuUjl0aDFRbHBUczE2ckZuelppOTNjYXNHVWN5clFwemxfOFptbXE2X05MSlNtenFSNGluUW9fQ2dkbzlfRXpxRExTX0RwZjh2UE95cXBUUVpGVkJOWG00ZFExaTdXblBLaVZmV2RLUzljRDhQRU16OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9DdVVrZWxzbFV3Tnk3MmVwYml3Nmp3aERTN2FzQlh2a2pHMEF4TEtyQVY2OExnVU5zNDZVSlRucWpmVW83UGw2YkR0Y0lZWTZXTFBycTBWVW5LZVFuTXYyOEpxQnlfWE0xREJTMG9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;news.sbs.co.kr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOT1VHLWxMbENQekJxbG9BOXdqcHlaSnFDLU5mV2NRN0J1LS